[0.022, "o", "\r\u001b[4m\u001b[1mWhat's new in wsp v0.22.0\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mBreaking: Git 2.41 or newer required\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\nUpgrade Git before using wsp if you run an older version.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mNative support for more coding harnesses\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\nMore coding harnesses can discover wsp’s workspace guidance and skills\u001b[m\r\nnatively through \u001b[1mAGENTS.md\u001b[0m and \u001b[1m.agents/\u001b[0m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mFixes\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\n- \u001b[1mwsp repo add\u001b[0m and repository fetches handle branch directories with\u001b[m\r\n  different casing, such as \u001b[1mKern/\u001b[0m and \u001b[1mkern/\u001b[0m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\nFull commit log: https://github.com/jganoff/wsp/releases/tag/v0.22.0\u001b[m\r\n\r\u001b[K"]
